# Elimination in the cage test arena: six bots swap the fuse often, so fuses run low together and the fuse ramp (after 90 s)
# finishes them between about 105 s and 140 s. Out players get an out order and lose their character after blastRemove,
# a new it is picked among the rest, and the last one standing ends round 1 with placement points (10 for 1st ... 2 for 6th).
# By 142 s round 2's countdown has reset the round (outCount 0) while lastPlace and score keep round 1's result.
seed 7
scene scenes/tests/cage.scene
tick 104s outCount == 0
tick 109s outCount == 1
tick 109s itSlot == 4
tick 142s flow.phase == Countdown
tick 142s flow.round == 1
tick 142s outCount == 0
tick 142s roundWinner == 1
tick 142s slots[0].lastPlace == 3
tick 142s slots[1].lastPlace == 1
tick 142s slots[2].lastPlace == 4
tick 142s slots[3].lastPlace == 6
tick 142s slots[4].lastPlace == 5
tick 142s slots[5].lastPlace == 2
tick 142s slots[0].score == 5
tick 142s slots[5].score == 7
